span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">추천부문</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학술</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">·</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과학과 인문 분야에서 탁월한 실적을 거두었거나 미래를 선 도할만한 발전 가능성을 보인 청소년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">차산업 영역 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">게 임개발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인공지능 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;나. </font>문화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">·</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예술 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예술 부문에서 탁월한 실적을 거두었거나 미래 성장 가능성<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 지닌 청소년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">마술</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">무용 등 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;다.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">체육 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">체육부문에서 탁월한 실적을 거두었거나 미래 성장 가능성을 지닌 청소년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대한체육회 회원 단체 종목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">바둑 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">))</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;라.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사회봉사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">·</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">진로개척 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">따뜻한 인간미를 바탕으로 봉사와 희생정신을 발휘한 청소 년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자신의 진로를 진취적으로 개척하여 다른 사람의 모범 이 된 청소년</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;마.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">스카우트 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">스카우트 정신을 토대로 각 분야에서 두드러진 활동을 통해 스카우트 의 위상을 높이 스카우트 대원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">후보자자격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대한민국 청소년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font